{"title": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span>", "slides": [{"id": "c2-system-phase:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🧊 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical Properties of Matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的物理性质</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A glass of iced cola: how many phases? Count the visible parts — ice, liquid, bubbles — and you have the answer. Questions like this are quick marks once you know the counting rule.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一杯加冰的可乐有几个相？数一数看得见的部分——冰、液体、气泡——答案就出来了。掌握数相的规则，这类题就是送分题。</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●●○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 25 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System = what you are studying. Phase = a uniform part of the system.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系＝研究对象。相＝体系中均一的部分。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Different states or layers = different phases. Gas mixtures = 1 phase. Solutions = 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不同状态或分层＝不同的相。气体混合物＝1 相。溶液＝1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Class T/F: looks uniform → one phase (True); boundary → more than one phase (True).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">讲义判断题：看起来均匀→一个相（对）；有分界→不止一个相（对）。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 222\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phases in beakers\"><rect x=\"32\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#f4c542\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">oil</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 油</tspan></text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"117\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#7cc4f2\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><path d=\"M28 30 L32 170 L158 170 L162 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">oil + water → 2 phases</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">2 个相</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"106\" fill=\"#9fd3f7\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">salt water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 盐水</tspan></text><path d=\"M208 30 L212 170 L338 170 L342 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">salt water → 1 phase</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">1 个相</text><rect x=\"402\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"56\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"478\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">ice</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 冰</tspan></text><rect x=\"392\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"106\" fill=\"#7cc4f2\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><path d=\"M388 30 L392 170 L518 170 L522 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">ice + water → 2 phases</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">2 个相</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Counting phases</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数一数有几个相</span></span></p><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 222\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phases in beakers\"><rect x=\"42\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"56\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"118\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">ice</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 冰</tspan></text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#f4c542\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">oil</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 油</tspan></text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"117\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#7cc4f2\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><path d=\"M28 30 L32 170 L158 170 L162 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">oil + water + ice → 3 phases</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">3 个相</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#9fd3f7\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"117\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#d9b77a\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">sand</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 沙</tspan></text><path d=\"M208 30 L212 170 L338 170 L342 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">sand in water → 2 phases</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">2 个相</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Counting phases with several states and layers</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多状态、多分层时数相</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Students count substances or forget that gases merge into one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生会去数物质，或忘了气体会合成一个相。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">All gases together → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有气体合起来→1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Each liquid layer → 1 phase each.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每个液体层→各 1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Each different solid → 1 phase each. Add them up.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每种不同的固体→各 1 相。加起来。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Oil, water and ice cubes in a beaker (class example).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">烧杯里有油、水和冰块（讲义例子）。</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">3 phases</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">3 个相</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Two gases = 2 phases → gases always mix into 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种气体＝2 相 → 气体总是混成 1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Salt water = 2 phases (two substances) → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">盐水＝2 相（两种物质）→ 1 相。</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tnote\">🟡 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Your class answer key marks \"If two substances look uniform throughout, they must be one phase\" as True. Many textbooks would add that looking uniform is a good sign but not proof. On this test answer True.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">课堂答案把「两种物质看起来处处均匀，就一定是一个相」判为「对」。很多教材会补充：看起来均匀是很好的迹象，但不是证明。考试按讲义答「对」。</span></div></div><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Count visibly different parts, not substances.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数看得见的不同部分，不是数物质。</span></div></div>"}], "cards": [{"id": "c2-system-phase.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The part of the universe you are studying — what you focus on.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你正在研究的那部分宇宙——你关注的对象。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Phase?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A part of a system that is uniform in composition and properties.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系中组成和性质都均一的部分。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Phases in oil + water? In salt water?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">油＋水有几个相？盐水呢？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Oil + water: 2. Salt water: 1.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">油＋水：2。盐水：1。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A mixture of two gases: how many phases?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种气体的混合物有几个相？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Always 1.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">永远是 1 个。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What does a visible boundary tell you?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看得见分界线说明什么？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">There is more than one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不止一个相。</span></div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "c2-system-phase.p1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Term: the part of the universe being studied.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">术语：正在研究的那部分宇宙。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Key idea: it focuses on what you are studying.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">关键：它就是你研究的对象。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The part being studied is the system.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">被研究的部分就是体系。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How many phases are in a sealed jar of pure nitrogen gas?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一个装有纯氮气的密封罐里有几个相？</span></div>", "opts": ["0", "1", "2", "3"], "a": 1, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Is there any boundary?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有分界线吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"\">1</div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Uniform gas, no layers → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">均一气体、无分层→1 个相。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p3", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How many phases? A glass of soda with ice cubes and bubbles rising through it.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有几个相？一杯加了冰块、有气泡上升的汽水。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Count states: solid? liquid? gas?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数状态：有固体吗？液体？气体？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">3 (ice, liquid soda, gas bubbles)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">3（冰、液体汽水、气泡）</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ice (solid) + soda (liquid, sugar and gas dissolved = 1 phase) + bubbles (gas) = 3.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冰（固）＋汽水（液，溶解的糖和气体算 1 相）＋气泡（气）＝3。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p4", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How many phases? Sugar stirred into water until it completely dissolves.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有几个相？糖放进水里搅拌到完全溶解。</span></div>", "opts": ["1", "2", "3", "0"], "a": 0, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Can you see the sugar any more?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">还能看到糖吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"\">1</div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Two substances but uniform throughout → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种物质，但处处均一→1 个相。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p5", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">True or False: if a boundary can be seen between two substances, there is more than one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">判断：如果两种物质之间能看到分界线，就不止一个相。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Think of oil on water.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">想想水上的油。</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">True</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">对</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A boundary means the two parts differ → different phases → True.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有分界说明两部分不同→不同的相→对。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p6", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Identify the system: a student studies how fast frost forms on the inside of a freezer door from moist air.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">找出体系：学生研究冰箱冷冻室门内侧由潮湿空气结霜的快慢。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What turns into frost, and where does it form?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">什么变成了霜？在哪里形成？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The inside surface of the freezer door and the water vapour in the air.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">冷冻室门的内表面和空气中的水蒸气。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Water vapour in the air is what changes; the cold door surface is where it happens.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">空气中的水蒸气是发生变化的东西；冷的门表面是发生的地方。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p7", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How many phases? A sealed bottle half full of liquid water, with water vapour and air in the space above.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有几个相？一个密封瓶装了一半液态水，上方空间里有水蒸气和空气。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Do the two gases form separate phases?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种气体会分成两个相吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">2 (liquid water; one gas phase of air + water vapour)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">2（液态水；空气与水蒸气组成的一个气相）</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid water → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液态水→1 个相。</span></div>", "whys": null}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.p8", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A student shakes oil and vinegar salad dressing. Right after shaking it looks cloudy and mixed; after 10 minutes it separates into two layers. Count the phases after 10 minutes and explain whether shaking ever made it 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生摇晃油醋沙拉汁。刚摇完看起来浑浊、混在一起；10 分钟后分成两层。数一数 10 分钟后的相数，并说明摇晃是否曾让它变成 1 个相。</span></div>", "opts": null, "a": null, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Does cloudy mean uniform?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">浑浊算均一吗？</span></div>", "ans": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">2 phases (oil layer and vinegar layer). Shaking never made 1 phase: the cloudy look shows oil droplets spread through the vinegar, so it was never uniform.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">2 个相（油层和醋层）。摇晃从未形成 1 个相：浑浊说明油滴散布在醋中，从来不是均一的。</span></div>", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">After 10 min: two layers with a boundary → 2 phases.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">10 分钟后：两层、有分界→2 个相。</span></div>", "whys": null}], "v": 1, "key": "topic-c2-system-phase"}